## Where leads go

The lead form POSTs to `/api/lead` which proxies to `{{leadEndpoint}}` with `source={{slug}}`. From there, leads land in:
- Telegram (`autoflowr-site` chat)
- Airtable (`Leads` table)

## Deploy commands

```bash
# Production (Vercel)
npx vercel deploy --prod

# Re-ping IndexNow after content updates
npm run indexnow
```

## Don't change without thinking

- `next.config.mjs` CSP allow-list — adding/removing domains will break Pixel/GA4/Clarity
- `app/layout.tsx` font preload — Heebo CLS is sensitive to load order
- `public/{{indexnowKey}}.txt` — IndexNow ownership proof; don't delete
- `lib/utils/normalizePhoneIL.ts` — phone format handler; downstream WhatsApp/Telegram depend on E.164

